## SLA Summary

| Severity | Reakcja | MTTR | Trigger examples |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Critical / Down** | 2h | 8h | Aplikacja zwraca 5xx, timeout, UptimeRobot DOWN |
| **Degraded** | 4h | 24h | >1% 5xx errors, p95 latency >5s, PDF gen fail |
| **Security** | 1h | Natychmiastowa izolacja | Unauthorized access, secrets leak, data breach |
| **Low** | Next business day | 72h | Single error in Sentry, UptimeRobot brief blip |

