## 8. Incident log format

Każdy incident odnotuj w `artifacts/audit-trail/incidents.log`:

```
YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS UTC | SEVERITY | STATUS: [OPEN/RESOLVED] | [OPIS JEDNOLINIJKOWY]
```

Przykład:
```
2026-05-29 14:32:00 UTC | DEGRADED | STATUS: RESOLVED | PDF generation 500 error — Prisma connection pool exhausted after deploy, fixed by pool size config increase
```
